<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TABLE-Czech utility SME H1 profit down.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Czech utility SME H1 profit down.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for six-month period</p>
<p>ending June 30, 1997: (in millions of crowns)</p>
<p> pre-tax profit		375.069	  589.006</p>
<p> after-tax profit	    398.929	  593.177</p>
<p> operating profit	    374.290	  528.132</p>
<p> depreciation		  249.472	  246.092</p>
<p>sales of own goods</p>
<p>	 and services	6,713.928	6,813.806</p>
<p> sales of other goods	  1.206	    1.121</p>
<p> basic capital	     3,315.142	3,315.142</p>
<p> total assets	     10,209.613     11,291.975</p>
<p>Note. Full company name is Severomoravska Energetika (SME), an energy  distributor for the northeastern Czech Republic. Results filed with  Prague Stock Exchange and provided by the bourse.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
